ate-specific tests, metadata, execution metrics, or dynamic-access report were generated.\n\nInspect:\n- `logs/do-work-20261018-172551.log`\n- `logs/org.hibernate:hibernate:3.2.6.ga/discover-artifact-metadata/discover_artifact_metadata.log`\n- `logs/org.hibernate:hibernate:3.2.6.ga/library-preparation-preflight/claude-code-session-s_lkk420.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Rerun the preparation preflight and artifact-metadata discovery with an agent account that has available quota.\n2. Verify the discovered artifact metadata, then resume the workflow from the setup phase to generate the test scaffold.\n3. Run the coordinate-scoped metadata validation and JVM/native tests, then confirm that execution metrics and dynamic-access coverage are produced.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_03d62d91192c2de0016ad7f52d27a887d09d6b894b964d047f\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 1269, "output": 826, "cacheRead": 71296, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 516, "totalTokens": 73391, "cost": {"input": 0.005076, "output": 0.01652, "cacheRead": 0.028518400000000003, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0501144}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1792537887657, "responseId": "resp_03d62d91192c2de0016ad7f52032ec87d0b419374408b489c9", "rawStopReason": "completed"}}
